OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will stay dry throughout the
OL,6,Fday on Monday with sunshine perhaps
OL,7,Fquite hazy at first, but good
OL,8,Fprolonged sunny spells developing.
OL,9,FFresh southerly winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FClear spells at first in the
OL,12,Fevening but gradually clouding over
OL,13,Ffrom the south. Staying cloudy
OL,14,Fovernight with perhaps the odd spot of
OL,15,Flight rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
