OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FLargely cloudy and rather
OL,6,Fbreezy with some patchy light rain,
OL,7,Fbut some bright spells possible for
OL,8,FShetland. A chance of this rain
OL,9,Fturning heavier and more persistent
OL,10,Flater over Orkney.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,13,FRemaining cloudy and quite breezy with
OL,14,Fsome rain on Wednesday. Bright spells
OL,15,Fand showers on Thursday and Friday
OL,16,Fmorning. Chance of persistent heavy
OL,17,Frain later on Friday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
